  <div class="prose">
    <p>Text Milo, Greg Jones's scheduling assistant, at <strong>(949) 822-7501</strong> to set up a time with Greg. Msg frequency varies. Msg &amp; data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help.</p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>Milo is an automated assistant that handles Greg's scheduling. It only replies: a conversation starts when you text the number, or when Greg adds it to a group text. Milo checks Greg's calendar, proposes times, confirms the plan, and lets Greg know. Its first reply tells you who it is.</p>

    <h2>Stopping</h2>
    <p>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time and Milo will not text you again. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or email <a href="mailto:admin@gregjones.io">admin@gregjones.io</a>.</p>

